# Input

```svelte
<span><div>hi</div><span>hi</span>hi<p>hi</p><span>hi</span>hi<span>hi</span></span>
```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
-<span
-    ><div>hi</div>
+<span>
+    <div>hi</div>
     <span>hi</span>hi
     <p>hi</p>
     <span>hi</span>hi<span>hi</span></span
```

# Output

```svelte
<span>
    <div>hi</div>
    <span>hi</span>hi
    <p>hi</p>
    <span>hi</span>hi<span>hi</span></span
>
